 "name": "Supply + 12AX7 driver + 6L6 push-pull + OT + speaker (validation circuit)",
 "description": "GZ34 full-wave supply on 60 Hz mains (2 x 350 Vrms CT), 40 \u00b5F reservoir, 100 \u03a9 + 4 H choke to the 'bp2' node (40 \u00b5F) that feeds the output transformer centre tap and screens, 10 k\u03a9 to 'bp3' (22 \u00b5F) feeding a 12AX7 driver whose plate drives the push-pull pair through ideal unity drivers (+ and \u2212). Run with and without the B+ cuts to measure the cut error; both are checked against ngspice. Every node of the supply chain (bp1, ch, bp2, bp3) is listed as a cut: elements between cut nodes form the supply partition, and anything reaching a non-cut node is a load.",
